title: 'pallet-revive: align eth tx decoding and reuse decoded call in dry runs'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: 'Small consistency and performance change: Align the decoding of substrate
    calls via Eth TX with the decoding of `generic::UncheckedExtrinsic`. Also reuse
    the decoded call in the dry run.'
